[{:adr/authoritative_for ["cloud-itonami-isic-6311 actor scope (multi-asset market-data collection/holding/update/disclosure -- equities/FX/commodities/crypto/real-estate indices, narrowed from generic ISIC 6311 data-processing/hosting)"
